{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Crossing is a third person co-op shooter, set in an 80's americana heartland.</strong>  <br><strong>You play as a crew of ghost hunting contractors,</strong> <br><strong>tasked with cleaning up an invasion of ghosts,</strong> <br><strong>possessing dead\u00a0remains  and discarded technology. </strong> <br><strong> </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ectoplasm is the new oil. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes an obstacle,\u00a0 often a valuable resource.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/00200fbc77aa7edaba43afc26b3517ce.poster.avif?t=1772642365\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/00200fbc77aa7edaba43afc26b3517ce.webm?t=1772642365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/00200fbc77aa7edaba43afc26b3517ce.mp4?t=1772642365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each encounter is different,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>optimize your loadout for the job.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480600/extras/a9783dda7a3e620e8775eca460df23d4.poster.avif?t=1772642365\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets